{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The YubiKit Swift SDK provides a modern async\/await version of the YubiKit framework, making it easy to integrate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in Swift and SwiftUI based applications. The async\/await syntax provides an easy to read and powerful way of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"creating connections and sending commands to the different applications on the YubiKey."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let connection = try await NFCSmartCardConnection()","let session = try await OATHSession.makeSession(connection: connection)","let codes = try await session.calculateCredentialCodes()"]},{"type":"aside","style":"warning","name":"Warning","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This SDK does not perform zeroization of sensitive data in memory. Cryptographic keys, PIN tokens,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and other secrets are not securely erased when no longer in use. This is currently out of scope but may be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"addressed in a future release."}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/GettingStarted"],"title":"Preparing your project","anchor":"Preparing-your-project"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/OATHSampleCode","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/PIVToolSampleCode","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthnInterceptorSampleCode"],"title":"Sample code","anchor":"Sample-code"},{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The implementations of the "},{"type":"reference","identifie